    <briefdescription>
<para>Redirection data node. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Stored in t_cmd.redirs and t_group.redirs as t_list* (each node-&gt;content is a t_redir*). No *next field.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>fd</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>source fd (-1 = default for the operator type). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>target</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>raw filename or fd number string (unexpanded). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>heredoc_delim</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>the delimiter word for &lt;&lt; (raw, may be quoted). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>heredoc_content</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>collected heredoc content (filled after parse, before exec). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>heredoc_quoted</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>1 if delimiter was quoted (no expansion inside heredoc). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
